# BMad AI Workflow Rules

- Always check `.bmad/` for project context, architecture decisions, and task briefs before coding.
- When executing multi-step planning or build tasks, adopt the appropriate persona defined in `.bmad/agents/`.
- For planning: follow BMad tasks and enforce quality gates using `.bmad/checklists/`.
- For changes/code generation: follow `bmad-build` guidelines and update relevant story docs.
